        {
          "text": "Zibeoni yaali na vayaayi 2: Aya, na Ana. Uyu ni Ana uwanyola visinukiru via mazi amahiu mwigendanyama lwa yaali niyayizaa zibarasi zia baba weve Zibeoni.",
